# ===== ORIGINAL NOTEBOOK CELL 61 =====
# ============================================================
# SECTION F — VALUATION ENGINE
# CELL F3 — HISTORICAL NORMALIZATION + FORECAST ASSUMPTIONS
# ============================================================
#
# Purpose:
#
#   Convert the validated F2/F2A financial data into
#   normalized company economics and explicit 5-year
#   Base / Bull / Bear forecast assumptions.
#
#
# F3 DOES:
#
#   Operating / FCFF companies:
#
#       - historical revenue CAGR
#       - normalized EBIT margin
#       - normalized tax rate
#       - D&A intensity
#       - CapEx intensity
#       - working-capital investment intensity
#       - historical FCF margin
#       - analyst revenue-growth anchor
#       - 5-year revenue-growth path
#       - 5-year EBIT-margin path
#
#
#   Financial companies:
#
#       - normalized ROE
#       - payout ratio
#       - book value per share
#       - normalized earnings growth
#       - analyst EPS-growth anchor
#       - 5-year ROE / earnings-growth path
#
#
#   Specialized models:
#
#       - Energy uses mid-cycle normalization
#       - Biopharma carries mandatory pipeline-review flag
#       - Financials remain separate from industrial FCFF
#
#
# F3 DOES NOT:
#
#       - calculate WACC / cost of equity
#       - calculate terminal value
#       - calculate enterprise value
#       - calculate fair value
#       - use current stock price to shape forecasts
#
#
# F4 will handle cost of capital + intrinsic valuation.
# ============================================================


