# ===== ORIGINAL NOTEBOOK CELL 69 =====
# ============================================================
# SECTION F — VALUATION ENGINE
# CELL F4E0 — BROAD PEER-UNIVERSE SOURCE DISCOVERY
#             + SCHEMA AUDIT V1.0.1
# ============================================================
#
# Purpose:
#
#   Locate the broader current research universe that should
#   provide comparable companies for F4E.
#
#
# F4D correctly freezes the frozen VALUATION universe.
#
# The COMPARABLE-COMPANY universe may be broader.
#
# This diagnostic searches:
#
#   1. in-memory pandas DataFrames
#   2. existing parquet / CSV artifacts
#
# for:
#
#   - broad ticker coverage
#   - GICS / industry metadata
#   - market value / EV inputs
#   - EBITDA / EBIT / D&A
#   - net income
#   - book equity
#   - debt / cash
#
#
# It DOES NOT:
#
#   - alter the frozen valuation universe
#   - change F4D
#   - calculate new multiples
#   - calculate intrinsic value
#
# ============================================================


# ============================================================
# 1. IMPORTS
# ============================================================

from pathlib import Path

