# ===== ORIGINAL NOTEBOOK CELL 70 =====
# ============================================================
# SECTION F — VALUATION ENGINE
# CELL F4E — INDUSTRY-AWARE BROAD COMPARABLE-COMPANY
#            + FINAL BROAD-PEER RESOLUTION ENGINE V1.1.0
# ============================================================
#
# Purpose:
#
#   Replace F4D's narrow 35-company comparable universe with
#   a broader CURRENT comparable-company universe while
#   preserving the exact frozen frozen valuation universe.
#
#
# Upstream sources discovered by F4E0:
#
#   Fundamentals:
#       cached_fundamentals
#
#   Industry metadata:
#       SP500_CONSTITUENTS
#
#
# Peer hierarchy:
#
#   1. SAME GICS SUB-INDUSTRY
#
#      Prefer 3+ target-excluded economic entities.
#      Allow 2 entities with reduced confidence.
#
#
#   2. SAME SECTOR + FUNDAMENTAL SIMILARITY
#
#      Select nearest companies using:
#
#          market-cap scale
#          revenue scale
#          EBITDA margin
#
#
#   3. BROAD SAME-METRIC + FUNDAMENTAL SIMILARITY
#
#      Last-resort fallback.
#
#
# Terminal metric:
#
#   Corporate / energy / refinery / biopharma proxy:
#       EV / EBITDA
#
#   Banks / insurance:
#       Price / Book
#
#   Other financial / health insurer:
#       Price / Earnings
#
#
# IMPORTANT:
#
#   - target ticker excluded
#   - other listed share classes of the SAME ECONOMIC ENTITY
#     are also excluded
#
#     e.g.:
#
#         GOOGL cannot use GOOG
#         FOXA cannot use FOX
#
#
#   - valuation universe remains frozen
#   - broad peer universe does NOT alter stock-selection output
#   - no intrinsic value is calculated
#   - biopharma remains provisional / non-rankable
#
#
# F5 must require:
#
#       F4E_PASSED == True
#       VALUATION_PRE_F5_PASSED == True
#
# ============================================================


